---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import Footer from "../components/Footer.astro";

const lastUpdated = "April 2026";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Terms of Service — Knowable"
  description="Terms of Service for Knowable — the AI coaching app for math and physics practice."
>
  <article class="py-16 sm:py-24">
    <div class="max-w-2xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <header class="mb-12">
        <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mb-3">
          Terms of Service
        </h1>
        <p class="text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 text-sm">Last updated: {lastUpdated}</p>
      </header>

      <div class="prose prose-slate dark:prose-invert max-w-none space-y-8 text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mb-3">1. About Knowable</h2>
          <p>
            Knowable is a macOS application ("the App") and supporting web service ("the Service") that uses on-device camera input and AI-generated coaching to help students practice math and physics problems. The Service is operated by Knowable and its founders ("we", "us", "our").
          </p>
          <p class="mt-3">
            By downloading the App or using the Service (including this website), you agree to these Terms of Service ("Terms"). If you do not agree, do not use the Service.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mb-3">2. Eligibility</h2>
          <p>
            You must be at least 13 years old to use the Service. If you are under the age of majority in your province or territory, you represent that a parent or legal guardian has reviewed and agreed to these Terms on your behalf. If you are using the Service on behalf of an educational institution, you represent that you have authority to bind that institution to these Terms.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mb-3">3. Account registration</h2>
          <p>
            An account may be required to access certain features. You are responsible for maintaining the confidentiality of your credentials and for all activity that occurs under your account. You agree to notify us immediately at <a href="mailto:terms@knowable.ca" class="text-milo-500 hover:underline">terms@knowable.ca</a> if you suspect unauthorised access.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mb-3">4. Acceptable use</h2>
          <p>You agree not to:</p>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-6 mt-3 space-y-2">
            <li>Use the Service to cheat during a graded exam, test, or assessment where AI assistance is prohibited by your institution.</li>
            <li>Attempt to reverse-engineer, decompile, or extract model weights, prompts, or proprietary algorithms from the Service.</li>
            <li>Automate or scrape the Service in any way that places unreasonable load on our infrastructure.</li>
            <li>Submit false information, including fake email addresses, to the waitlist or any form.</li>
            <li>Use the Service for any unlawful purpose or in violation of any applicable local, provincial, or federal law.</li>
            <li>Attempt to circumvent usage limits, CAPTCHA protections, or rate limits.</li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mb-3">5. Content ownership</h2>
          <p>
            <strong>Your content is yours.</strong> You retain full ownership of any notes, notebook pages, problem solutions, or other content you create while using the App. We do not claim any licence to your original work.
          </p>
          <p class="mt-3">
            The AI-generated hints and coaching responses produced by the Service are provided for personal educational use. We grant you a limited, non-exclusive, non-transferable licence to use them for that purpose. You may not resell, republish, or redistribute AI-generated coaching content at scale.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mb-3">6. Apple platforms — additional terms</h2>
          <p>
            The App is distributed through the Apple App Store. To the extent that you download the App via the App Store, the following applies:
          </p>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-6 mt-3 space-y-2">
            <li>These Terms are between you and Knowable only, not Apple. Apple is not responsible for the App or its content.</li>
            <li>Apple has no obligation to provide maintenance, support, or warranty services for the App.</li>
            <li>In the event of any third-party intellectual property claim related to the App, Apple is not responsible for the investigation, defence, settlement, or discharge of such claim.</li>
            <li>Apple and its subsidiaries are third-party beneficiaries of these Terms, and upon your acceptance, Apple will have the right to enforce these Terms against you as a third-party beneficiary.</li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mb-3">7. No warranty</h2>
          <p>
            The Service is provided <strong>"as is" and "as available"</strong> without warranty of any kind, express or implied, including but not limited to warranties of merchantability, fitness for a particular purpose, accuracy, or non-infringement. We do not warrant that the Service will be uninterrupted, error-free, or that AI-generated hints will be mathematically correct.
          </p>
          <p class="mt-3">
            AI coaching is a supplement to, not a replacement for, instruction from qualified teachers. Always verify important results independently.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mb-3">8. Limitation of liability</h2>
          <p>
            To the maximum extent permitted by applicable law, Knowable and its founders shall not be liable for any indirect, incidental, special, consequential, or punitive damages arising from your use of or inability to use the Service, even if we have been advised of the possibility of such damages. Our total liability to you for any claim arising from these Terms or the Service shall not exceed the greater of (a) the amount you paid us in the 12 months preceding the claim or (b) CAD $50.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mb-3">9. Termination</h2>
          <p>
            We may suspend or terminate your access to the Service at any time, with or without notice, if you breach these Terms or if we discontinue the Service. You may terminate your account at any time by contacting <a href="mailto:terms@knowable.ca" class="text-milo-500 hover:underline">terms@knowable.ca</a>. Upon termination, your right to use the Service ceases immediately.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mb-3">10. Changes to the Service and Terms</h2>
          <p>
            We may modify the Service or these Terms at any time. Material changes to Terms will be communicated by email to registered users at least 14 days in advance. Continued use of the Service after changes take effect constitutes acceptance of the revised Terms.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mb-3">11. Governing law</h2>
          <p>
            These Terms are governed by and construed in accordance with the laws of the Province of <strong>Ontario</strong> and the federal laws of <strong>Canada</strong> applicable therein, without regard to conflict of law principles. Any dispute arising from these Terms shall be subject to the exclusive jurisdiction of the courts of Ontario, Canada.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-slate-900 dark:text-white mb-3">12. Contact</h2>
          <p>
            Questions about these Terms? Email us at:<br />
            <a href="mailto:terms@knowable.ca" class="text-milo-500 hover:underline">terms@knowable.ca</a>
          </p>
        </section>

      </div>
    </div>
  </article>

  <Footer slot="footer" />
</BaseLayout>
